# (option 10: topic bit 3; 1: bit 0; 2: bit 1; 3: bit 2; 0: clamped to bit 0; 5: clamped to bit 3) answering the
# topics and 1; finished: completed (the Raillefal's Letter, Confessions of Royalty current).
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Cacaroon/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Cacaroon/onTrade AhtUrhganWhitegate/Nadeey/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/4 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/5 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventUpdate/3026 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3022 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3024 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3026 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3035
